# UNIKEY Farmer proxy list — 1 proxy per line
# Format yang didukung:
#   http://user:pass@host:port
#   socks5://host:port
#   host:port            (default http://)
#   direct               (pakai IP VPS, tanpa proxy)
#
# Tips:
# - 1 worker = 1 proxy unik (wajib, rate-limit per-IP)
# - Datacenter proxy cepat kena rate limit, residential lebih aman
# - Contoh:
# http://user:pass@residential.example.com:8807
# socks5://127.0.0.1:40000
# direct
